WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.660 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 12=

01:40.780 --> 01:42.860
Do you have a wife back home?

01:44.220 --> 01:44.860
Your Majesty,

01:45.500 --> 01:45.940
I do not.

01:47.030 --> 01:47.910
What do you think

01:49.190 --> 01:50.940
of my daughter, Princess Danyang?

02:00.910 --> 02:01.500
I dare not presume

02:01.940 --> 02:03.110
to comment on Her Highness.

02:03.940 --> 02:04.910
Let's leave it at that.

02:07.190 --> 02:08.460
I'd like to play matchmaker

02:09.390 --> 02:11.420
and offer Princess Danyang
your hand in marriage.

02:11.860 --> 02:12.420
What do you say?

02:22.620 --> 02:23.700
I wouldn't dare deceive Your Majesty.

02:27.230 --> 02:28.180
As it happens,

02:28.580 --> 02:29.390
one of my students

02:30.020 --> 02:31.900
has long admired Princess Danyang, too.

02:32.510 --> 02:33.390
Which student?

02:33.700 --> 02:37.350
Wei Shu, the Top Scholar
Your Majesty appointed.

02:39.830 --> 02:41.399
If he admires the Princess,

02:41.441 --> 02:43.011
why didn't he speak up earlier?

02:45.860 --> 02:46.860
Please forgive me, Your Majesty.

02:47.460 --> 02:50.110
Is your family the noble Wei clan?

02:51.900 --> 02:52.270
Yes.

02:52.860 --> 02:55.860
They say great families
are hard to fathom.

02:57.460 --> 02:58.510
I won't

02:59.510 --> 03:01.020
send Wanyao into one.

03:02.460 --> 03:03.020
Rise.

03:04.140 --> 03:04.950
Take your seats.

03:05.460 --> 03:06.180
Thank you, Your Majesty.

03:06.420 --> 03:07.070
Thank you, Your Majesty.

03:15.670 --> 03:16.110
Your Majesty,

03:16.900 --> 03:19.460
(General Yu arrives!)

03:25.300 --> 03:31.300
(Lanyue Hall)

03:36.830 --> 03:39.180
You're hosting
the realm's finest talents.

03:39.620 --> 03:41.900
Why wasn't I invited, Your Majesty?

03:42.950 --> 03:44.390
You've had your hands full.

03:44.670 --> 03:46.990
I didn't want to trouble you.

03:53.670 --> 03:56.350
I merely lighten Your Majesty's load.

03:56.790 --> 03:57.830
That hardly keeps me busy.

04:15.270 --> 04:16.030
Yuhan wine.

04:16.990 --> 04:18.030
A fine vintage from North Jing.

04:20.150 --> 04:21.180
Speaking of which,

04:22.990 --> 04:25.940
tribute wine from there
has grown scarce in recent years.

04:27.620 --> 04:27.990
Your Majesty,

04:29.470 --> 04:32.670
do you recall the customs
of the North Jing region?

04:34.350 --> 04:35.350
When a father or elder brother dies,

04:35.790 --> 04:36.910
his son or younger brother succeeds him.

04:38.180 --> 04:39.860
Though General Meng Baiyu has died,

04:40.350 --> 04:42.940
his successor is still of the Meng clan.

04:43.300 --> 04:43.620
So,

04:44.380 --> 04:45.180
I believe,

04:45.790 --> 04:47.420
Princess Danyang should marry

04:47.590 --> 04:50.110
neither the Top Scholar
nor the Third-Place Scholar,

04:52.500 --> 04:52.990
but

04:53.500 --> 04:55.710
Young General Meng,
the current military governor.

05:04.710 --> 05:05.260
Lord Yu,

05:06.300 --> 05:07.500
I'm a princess of Huai.

05:09.110 --> 05:11.030
Precisely because
you're a princess of Huai,

05:11.350 --> 05:14.470
you should put the people first.

05:15.470 --> 05:16.030
North Jing

05:16.500 --> 05:17.470
is far from stable.

05:25.620 --> 05:26.420
Lord Yu,

05:27.260 --> 05:30.230
we'll find another way
to secure North Jing.

05:31.740 --> 05:34.030
But when it comes to their marriage,

05:34.550 --> 05:35.940
we elders

05:36.500 --> 05:38.030
shouldn't force their hand.

05:38.300 --> 05:40.260
We should ask what they want.

05:43.230 --> 05:43.910
Third-Place Scholar.

05:46.420 --> 05:46.940
Your Majesty.

05:47.590 --> 05:49.860
I'm offering you
my daughter's hand in marriage.

05:50.060 --> 05:50.940
Will you accept?

06:00.110 --> 06:00.710
Your Majesty,

06:01.550 --> 06:01.910
I will

06:02.670 --> 06:03.150
accept.

06:03.690 --> 06:08.300
♪We weren't born for sacrifice.
Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

06:09.790 --> 06:10.470
(Yan Shang,)

06:10.860 --> 06:12.230
(at least you've got some backbone.)

06:13.300 --> 06:14.260
But I won't accept it.

06:14.560 --> 06:17.760
♪Who dares make me bow
down in the dust?♪

06:19.590 --> 06:20.180
Wanyao.

06:21.230 --> 06:22.639
You just asked what I wanted.

06:22.680 --> 06:24.055
♪If the road is blocked,
I'll fight my way through♪

06:24.580 --> 06:24.940
I won't marry him.

06:24.989 --> 06:28.081
♪Cut down the crowd,
strike down the proud gods♪

06:28.123 --> 06:29.813
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

06:33.060 --> 06:35.380
Princess Danyang knows
her duty to the realm.

06:35.710 --> 06:36.180
Good!

06:37.470 --> 06:37.860
Your Majesty,

06:39.790 --> 06:40.420
I congratulate you!

07:04.060 --> 07:04.590
Your Highness.

07:12.820 --> 07:13.550
Right now,

07:13.990 --> 07:15.420
the man who pleases her most

07:16.420 --> 07:17.910
is Yan Shang.

07:19.620 --> 07:21.590
Mr. Wei is probably too shy,

07:21.790 --> 07:24.030
unlike that bold third-place scholar.

07:24.230 --> 07:25.500
What third-place scholar?

07:26.300 --> 07:27.470
So affected and coy,

07:27.790 --> 07:28.790
with flirtatious eyes.

07:29.260 --> 07:30.710
He looks like a shameless rake.

07:31.420 --> 07:33.230
He couldn't even outscore Wei Shu.

07:34.710 --> 07:36.550
With that fox around,

07:37.470 --> 07:39.500
it's really unfair to Wei Shu.

07:40.060 --> 07:41.030
Exactly.

07:41.350 --> 07:43.060
We'll never understand

07:43.470 --> 07:45.470
these princesses' tastes.

07:57.230 --> 07:57.710
Your Highness,

07:58.380 --> 07:59.470
His Majesty arranged that marriage

07:59.710 --> 08:00.470
to help you.

08:01.500 --> 08:03.350
I know my father better than you do.

08:04.300 --> 08:05.500
A marriage would keep you

08:05.860 --> 08:07.030
from having to head north again.

08:07.470 --> 08:07.910
Yan Shang.

08:08.620 --> 08:09.420
Have you forgotten

08:09.910 --> 08:11.790
why I kept you by my side

08:12.110 --> 08:12.790
as my adviser?

08:13.590 --> 08:15.060
Have you forgotten
what I'm fighting for?

08:15.790 --> 08:16.710
When have I ever

08:17.060 --> 08:18.110
sought safety for myself?

08:18.180 --> 08:19.110
I haven't forgotten.

08:19.500 --> 08:20.670
That's why I came to tell you.

08:21.060 --> 08:21.670
Even if...

08:24.860 --> 08:26.230
Even if there's no love between us,

08:26.710 --> 08:27.820
we can pretend there is.

08:28.350 --> 08:28.740
In private,

08:29.300 --> 08:30.420
I'll still be your right-hand man.

08:31.230 --> 08:31.710
In public,

08:32.380 --> 08:33.740
we'd just play the loving couple.

08:34.710 --> 08:35.860
It's only a temporary fix.

08:36.310 --> 08:36.830
I won't pretend.

08:39.110 --> 08:39.839
If the Central Circuit

08:39.881 --> 08:41.491
comes demanding that marriage one day,

08:42.500 --> 08:43.660
at least we could hold them off.

08:43.900 --> 08:44.830
Yan Shang, listen carefully.

08:45.590 --> 08:47.710
I'm tired of being married off
like a pawn.

08:48.230 --> 08:49.990
Tired of having no choice
but to compromise.

08:50.070 --> 08:51.590
I won't stand for it anymore.

08:52.740 --> 08:52.990
Your Highness...

09:06.430 --> 09:07.740
Mu Wanyao, stop!

09:07.950 --> 09:08.990
Mr. Yang, don't!

09:13.520 --> 09:14.140
(Cui Family Residence)

09:16.020 --> 09:16.500
Wanyao!

09:19.900 --> 09:20.990
Were you trying to kill yourself

09:21.350 --> 09:22.110
or take me down with you?

09:23.380 --> 09:24.470
If you won't marry Yan Shang,

09:25.110 --> 09:25.740
why not marry me instead?

09:26.590 --> 09:27.660
Why turn us all down so flatly?

09:28.070 --> 09:29.860
Yang Si, who do you think you are?

09:30.900 --> 09:32.740
Can you stop Yu Cheng'an or Meng Zaishi?

09:33.500 --> 09:35.140
If Yu Cheng'an
was just messing around today,

09:35.350 --> 09:36.350
I won't have to marry anyone.

09:37.470 --> 09:38.950
But if he really wants to send me north,

09:39.540 --> 09:41.599
Yan Shang, you, and Wei Shu

09:41.641 --> 09:43.091
all marrying me together

09:43.310 --> 09:44.110
could not save me.

09:46.020 --> 09:46.620
When that happens,

09:47.070 --> 09:48.860
whoever becomes my consort
is as good as dead.

09:55.860 --> 09:56.409
Wanyao...

09:56.451 --> 09:57.251
Go home to shed your tears.

09:57.430 --> 09:58.110
I'm not dead yet.

09:58.660 --> 09:59.070
Get lost, too!

10:08.070 --> 10:09.230
What does she mean, "too"?

10:14.620 --> 10:14.990
Yan Shang.

10:16.350 --> 10:16.780
Wei Shu.

10:17.380 --> 10:18.110
Has the Imperial Uncle left?

10:20.140 --> 10:20.590
Yan Shang,

10:21.350 --> 10:23.830
why did Lord Yu suddenly say all that?

10:24.500 --> 10:26.740
Does he really intend
to send Her Highness north?

10:28.350 --> 10:29.990
North Jing has been quiet lately

10:30.380 --> 10:31.830
and at peace with the court for years.

10:32.310 --> 10:33.260
Yu Cheng'an was probably

10:33.740 --> 10:34.860
just speaking offhand.

10:35.020 --> 10:36.070
(Finally, the exams are over.)

10:36.140 --> 10:37.540
- (What a relief!)
- (You said it!)

10:37.660 --> 10:38.209
(Let's check over there.)

10:38.251 --> 10:38.921
(Come on, let's look this way.)

10:39.500 --> 10:40.430
Other people's lives,

10:40.710 --> 10:41.620
other people's futures,

10:42.070 --> 10:43.590
mean nothing to him.

10:44.140 --> 10:45.380
So he jokes about them so casually.

10:46.140 --> 10:46.710
Or perhaps,

10:47.500 --> 10:48.990
he just meant to give the Princess
a warning

10:49.230 --> 10:49.860
and scare her.

10:50.230 --> 10:51.190
If this villain isn't eliminated,

10:51.830 --> 10:52.620
the realm will never know peace.

10:53.590 --> 10:55.500
Say that to anyone else,

10:56.020 --> 10:56.990
and your family

10:57.620 --> 10:59.140
could be doomed by tomorrow.

11:03.660 --> 11:04.900
If you're right

11:05.590 --> 11:07.070
and Lord Yu
was just trying to scare her,

11:07.430 --> 11:08.140
then Her Highness

11:08.620 --> 11:09.900
is safe only for now.

11:11.590 --> 11:12.140
Exactly.

11:12.860 --> 11:14.110
The political landscape
can change overnight.

11:14.860 --> 11:15.710
The two military circuits in North Jing

11:16.660 --> 11:17.710
and the regional powers across the realm

11:18.190 --> 11:19.230
are poised to strike,

11:19.620 --> 11:20.380
all aimed at the Imperial Court.

11:21.660 --> 11:22.780
If the Central Circuit makes a move,

11:23.230 --> 11:23.710
the Princess

11:24.500 --> 11:25.830
will be the first sacrifice.

11:28.660 --> 11:29.110
Let's go.

11:29.780 --> 11:30.500
I need to go back

11:31.190 --> 11:32.070
and apologize to the Princess.

11:32.620 --> 11:33.020
What's wrong?

11:33.740 --> 11:34.500
I upset her again

11:35.540 --> 11:36.590
just now.

11:42.620 --> 11:43.830
I hear

11:46.110 --> 11:47.540
the new top scholar, Wei Shu,

11:49.070 --> 11:50.190
is your student.

11:50.540 --> 11:50.860
That's right.

11:52.070 --> 11:53.260
So why are you singing

11:53.900 --> 11:56.900
the third-place scholar's praises to me?

11:58.260 --> 11:59.190
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

12:00.310 --> 12:02.740
It's just that the third-place scholar

12:03.260 --> 12:04.230
is so charming.

12:04.660 --> 12:05.540
I couldn't help

12:05.950 --> 12:08.140
going on about him in front of you.

12:09.990 --> 12:11.260
Charming?

12:12.430 --> 12:14.990
That's not a word I'd expect to hear

12:15.950 --> 12:16.780
from you.

12:17.430 --> 12:18.950
Your Highness may not know this.

12:20.540 --> 12:22.140
That third-place scholar

12:22.230 --> 12:23.950
may not be the brightest,

12:24.710 --> 12:26.950
but his looks are second to none.

12:27.780 --> 12:28.590
I'd say

12:28.900 --> 12:31.380
he even outshines the men

12:31.950 --> 12:33.020
already by Your Highness's side.

12:47.380 --> 12:48.350
Who are those two?

12:54.310 --> 12:54.860
Your Highness,

12:55.620 --> 12:58.070
they're this year's top
and third-ranked scholars.

13:00.710 --> 13:01.900
The one in white

13:02.140 --> 13:03.140
is handsome enough,

13:04.020 --> 13:05.470
but a bit too young.

13:06.140 --> 13:07.070
He's not my type.

13:10.260 --> 13:11.620
What's the name of the one
in very pale cyan?

13:12.350 --> 13:12.740
Your Highness,

13:13.350 --> 13:15.260
that's Yan Shang,
the third-place scholar.

13:19.070 --> 13:19.620
Your Highness,

13:20.310 --> 13:22.070
was I wrong?

13:23.710 --> 13:25.020
For a man of your age,

13:25.540 --> 13:26.190
you certainly have

13:26.740 --> 13:27.380
a good eye.

13:31.620 --> 13:32.780
Feng Xianyu,

13:34.110 --> 13:34.950
isn't it ironic?

13:36.710 --> 13:39.110
If you hadn't come to me that day

13:39.500 --> 13:42.190
and turned down fame and rank
out of sheer pride,

13:42.950 --> 13:43.740
today,

13:44.430 --> 13:45.759
I wouldn't have seen

13:45.801 --> 13:48.041
such a handsome third-place scholar.

13:49.590 --> 13:50.590
So I suppose

13:51.190 --> 13:52.590
I owe you my thanks.

14:14.300 --> 14:16.940
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

14:51.110 --> 14:52.020
What's the rush?

14:52.260 --> 14:53.190
I have urgent news for Her Highness.

15:10.430 --> 15:11.020
Your Highness,

15:11.860 --> 15:12.620
Lord Yu requests an audience.

15:19.380 --> 15:25.660
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

15:29.460 --> 15:34.540
♪We weren't born for sacrifice.
Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

15:34.590 --> 15:36.990
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪

15:37.160 --> 15:40.420
♪Cold as a blade,
yet peerless as a bloom♪

15:40.820 --> 15:43.890
♪Who dares make me bow
down in the dust?♪

15:44.260 --> 15:46.730
♪With sacrificed innocence...♪

15:47.470 --> 15:47.950
Your Highness.

15:49.190 --> 15:49.660
Your Highness,

15:50.310 --> 15:51.344
Yan Shang is still standing in the rain.

15:51.386 --> 15:54.513
♪Cut down the crowd,
strike down the proud gods♪

15:54.555 --> 15:56.215
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

15:56.710 --> 15:57.479
Why are you standing

15:57.521 --> 15:58.561
outside my door like a statue?

15:58.950 --> 15:59.620
Say what you have to say.

16:01.110 --> 16:01.830
If it's nonsense,

16:02.140 --> 16:02.769
save your breath.

16:02.811 --> 16:05.599
♪Don't be afraid,
I'll become a demon for you♪

16:05.641 --> 16:08.189
♪Through fire,
I'll turn the dark towers...♪

16:08.231 --> 16:09.711
I don't know where to begin.

16:10.380 --> 16:11.740
I'll wait until Your Highness returns

16:12.260 --> 16:12.714
and explain everything then.

16:12.756 --> 16:16.502
♪Though this world is hard to cross,
I'll lead you through♪

16:16.544 --> 16:19.591
♪I dare face the unknown,
with my sword in hand♪

16:19.633 --> 16:24.203
♪I'll guard my princess,
and keep her tears at bay♪

16:56.660 --> 16:57.140
Your Highness,

16:57.950 --> 16:58.860
I don't understand.

16:59.140 --> 17:01.020
Why are you so angry with him?

17:03.860 --> 17:04.910
I'm not angry with him.

17:05.950 --> 17:06.910
The road ahead is dangerous,

17:07.230 --> 17:08.150
and our chances are slim.

17:09.500 --> 17:10.630
I just wanted to tell him

17:11.740 --> 17:13.300
not to get his hopes up.

17:14.780 --> 17:15.710
And remind myself, too.

17:21.910 --> 17:23.780
A handwritten letter
from General Meng Zaishi,

17:23.950 --> 17:25.990
the new military governor
of the Central Circuit,

17:27.910 --> 17:29.870
has just arrived in Sheng'an.

17:30.740 --> 17:31.060
Your Highness,

17:31.820 --> 17:34.300
did you know him
when you were in the north?

17:35.910 --> 17:36.670
Not really.

17:38.950 --> 17:40.100
That's odd.

17:40.870 --> 17:43.430
General Meng is already twenty-three

17:44.060 --> 17:45.020
and still unmarried.

17:45.910 --> 17:46.910
That's rare enough.

17:47.580 --> 17:50.020
Yet in his letter,
he didn't ask the Court

17:51.150 --> 17:52.230
to arrange a marriage for him.

17:52.670 --> 17:56.100
Instead, he asked after you
several times.

18:00.340 --> 18:00.780
Read it.

18:05.990 --> 18:07.820
As military governor
of the Central Circuit,

18:08.260 --> 18:09.470
General Meng must have included

18:10.100 --> 18:11.780
important matters of state
in his letter.

18:12.740 --> 18:14.340
I'm just an ignorant woman.

18:16.910 --> 18:17.580
I wouldn't dare read it.

18:21.910 --> 18:23.230
Forgive me. I spoke out of turn.

18:25.470 --> 18:26.430
In that case,

18:28.100 --> 18:29.470
I'll just read

18:30.100 --> 18:32.670
a few lines to Your Highness.

18:33.430 --> 18:34.340
He's nothing more than

18:34.670 --> 18:35.430
a stranger to me.

18:36.670 --> 18:37.670
I don't care

18:38.390 --> 18:39.060
what his letter says.

18:44.060 --> 18:44.580
True.

18:47.340 --> 18:48.020
But...

18:48.910 --> 18:52.710
what if General Meng wants you
to marry into North Jing again?

19:02.100 --> 19:03.390
I'm a princess of Huai.

19:04.340 --> 19:06.470
It's my duty to ease
the court's burdens.

19:07.470 --> 19:09.540
Besides, I've been married there once.

19:10.100 --> 19:11.020
There's no need to make a fuss.

19:13.740 --> 19:14.470
How sensible.

19:16.300 --> 19:18.190
Since returning from North Jing,

19:18.430 --> 19:20.780
Your Highness has grown
much more composed.

19:21.150 --> 19:21.740
Impressive.

19:22.780 --> 19:23.430
Indeed.

19:24.260 --> 19:26.870
Some people lose their lives

19:27.260 --> 19:29.870
because they don't know
the ways of the world.

19:32.230 --> 19:32.990
Actually,

19:33.540 --> 19:34.820
there's nothing urgent today.

19:35.540 --> 19:37.580
I was just curious.

19:38.150 --> 19:39.020
What exactly

19:40.020 --> 19:42.740
did you do in North Jing

19:43.150 --> 19:45.990
to make General Meng so taken with you?

19:54.100 --> 19:54.910
On second thought,

19:55.340 --> 19:55.950
there's no need to ask.

20:01.950 --> 20:03.500
Your Highness, please return.

20:11.430 --> 20:12.630
If General Meng

20:13.230 --> 20:14.910
really asks for your hand,

20:15.260 --> 20:17.390
it would help Huai

20:17.630 --> 20:18.780
keep the regional powers in check.

20:31.820 --> 20:36.090
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

20:36.140 --> 20:39.530
♪Don't be afraid,
I'll become a demon for you♪

20:39.580 --> 20:45.520
♪Through fire, I'll turn the dark towers
bright as day for you♪

20:46.090 --> 20:49.930
♪Though this world is hard to cross,
I'll lead you through♪

20:49.980 --> 20:53.300
♪I dare face the unknown,
with my sword in hand♪

20:53.350 --> 20:57.440
♪Slay wolves, tame tigers,
breach the city gates♪

21:11.740 --> 21:12.340
(Yu Cheng'an,)

21:13.780 --> 21:14.820
(this time, let's see)

21:16.740 --> 21:18.390
(will you kill me again,)

21:19.870 --> 21:21.430
(or will I kill you first?)

21:40.380 --> 21:44.420
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

21:54.670 --> 21:55.100
Your Highness.

21:57.060 --> 21:58.020
Third-Place Scholar,

21:58.740 --> 21:59.580
you know me?

22:00.060 --> 22:01.100
As a grand princess,

22:01.780 --> 22:03.540
who in Sheng'an doesn't?

22:05.100 --> 22:06.150
What a smooth talker.

22:07.340 --> 22:08.910
Come here. I have questions for you.

22:20.230 --> 22:20.950
Go ahead, Your Highness.

22:33.500 --> 22:34.580
Why are you backing away?

22:38.780 --> 22:39.540
Your Highness is a noble princess,

22:40.100 --> 22:40.990
while I'm just a common scholar.

22:41.580 --> 22:43.580
I'll stay here and hear you out.

22:45.540 --> 22:46.580
Oh, you haven't been appointed yet.

22:47.780 --> 22:48.670
No need to rush.

22:49.780 --> 22:51.710
Once we've had a proper chat,

22:52.190 --> 22:54.500
you won't have to worry
about that anymore.

22:55.670 --> 22:56.390
I appreciate

22:56.910 --> 22:57.870
Your Highness's kindness.

23:02.100 --> 23:03.190
Speaking of which,

23:04.020 --> 23:06.260
I've suddenly taken an interest
in history.

23:07.500 --> 23:08.340
However,

23:08.710 --> 23:09.990
there's a lot I don't understand.

23:12.020 --> 23:13.870
As a third-place scholar,
you must be well-read.

23:14.670 --> 23:17.230
Come to my residence and enlighten me.

23:22.540 --> 23:23.340
Forgive me, Your Highness.

23:24.260 --> 23:25.260
I'm just a country bumpkin

23:25.870 --> 23:26.740
with little talent or learning.

23:27.020 --> 23:27.740
I only passed the exam by luck.

23:28.580 --> 23:29.100
I'm afraid

23:29.950 --> 23:30.540
I'm not up to the task.

23:31.710 --> 23:32.150
I must take my leave.

23:34.820 --> 23:36.500
You've moved right next door
to Princess Danyang,

23:37.020 --> 23:38.580
so I thought you knew
how to play your cards.

23:39.670 --> 23:40.430
Turns out

23:41.150 --> 23:42.300
you're stubborn to the end.

23:43.820 --> 23:44.500
What,

23:45.100 --> 23:46.630
are you staying chaste for her?

23:50.740 --> 23:51.580
You're teasing me, Your Highness.

24:23.950 --> 24:24.740
When we get back,

24:25.020 --> 24:26.300
if Yan Shang is still waiting outside,

24:26.710 --> 24:27.470
let him in.

24:28.430 --> 24:29.390
Have you forgiven him?

24:30.060 --> 24:31.150
There's nothing to forgive.

24:32.300 --> 24:33.340
Keeping my distance for a few days

24:33.820 --> 24:34.500
will be better for us both.

24:36.630 --> 24:38.190
Then I'll invite him in

24:38.580 --> 24:40.150
and make some ginger tea to warm him up.

24:45.390 --> 24:46.780
(Peaceful days like this)

24:47.950 --> 24:49.020
(may be numbered.)

24:50.740 --> 24:52.020
(If my plans fail and I die,)

24:53.230 --> 24:53.710
(Yan Shang,)

24:54.820 --> 24:55.990
(how long will you remember me?)

25:03.990 --> 25:04.780
Careful, Your Highness.

25:13.740 --> 25:14.870
Isn't this the umbrella you gave him?

25:15.260 --> 25:15.990
Why did he leave it here?

25:19.430 --> 25:20.100
Here, Your Highness.

25:27.470 --> 25:27.910
Your Highness!

25:31.670 --> 25:32.190
Wei Shu?

25:32.740 --> 25:33.390
What brings you here?

25:33.630 --> 25:34.060
Your Highness,

25:34.470 --> 25:35.710
do you know where Yan Shang went?

25:36.230 --> 25:37.150
I'm worried about him.

25:37.470 --> 25:38.630
What's there to worry about?

25:39.390 --> 25:41.100
He was supposed
to study with me tonight.

25:41.870 --> 25:43.239
I waited outside his house for ages,

25:43.281 --> 25:44.081
but he never came back.

25:44.670 --> 25:45.740
He never misses an appointment.

25:45.990 --> 25:47.060
He's not one to break his word.

25:47.500 --> 25:48.100
You're right.

25:50.150 --> 25:51.020
He never breaks his promises.

25:58.780 --> 25:59.580
(Where could he have gone?)

26:00.230 --> 26:01.020
(Who summoned him?)

26:02.190 --> 26:02.580
(Or...)

26:03.100 --> 26:04.020
(who took him away?)

26:05.190 --> 26:05.910
(Yu Cheng'an?)

26:06.630 --> 26:07.340
(Li Zhi?)

26:08.060 --> 26:08.740
(Or Father?)

26:27.060 --> 26:28.060
You may all leave.

26:29.100 --> 26:31.670
Don't disturb me tonight.

26:50.820 --> 26:51.820
Yan Shang is clever.

26:52.150 --> 26:53.260
He should be fine.

26:53.820 --> 26:55.190
That depends on who's holding him

26:56.060 --> 26:56.820
and what trouble he's in.

27:06.100 --> 27:06.580
Your Highness.

27:07.740 --> 27:08.190
Found him?

27:08.540 --> 27:09.580
We've asked around.

27:09.870 --> 27:11.020
No one has seen Yan Shang.

27:13.910 --> 27:14.780
He's new to Sheng'an

27:15.260 --> 27:16.390
and barely knows anyone here.

27:18.060 --> 27:19.340
Who would want to harm him?

27:20.710 --> 27:21.580
Have you checked
the Crown Prince's place?

27:21.910 --> 27:22.470
I'll go now.

27:22.870 --> 27:23.390
Who's there?

27:23.710 --> 27:24.500
Who dares throw stones

27:24.630 --> 27:25.990
into the Princess's residence?

27:28.190 --> 27:28.820
Your Highness, look.

27:29.260 --> 27:30.710
There's a note wrapped around the stone.

27:32.340 --> 27:34.740
("He's at Xiangfeng Tower.")

27:38.950 --> 27:39.390
Fang Tong,

27:40.300 --> 27:40.950
gather the men.

27:41.430 --> 27:41.870
Come with me.

27:42.100 --> 27:43.100
Your Highness, where to?

27:44.100 --> 27:45.020
Grand Princess Luling's residence.

27:45.580 --> 27:46.150
Xiangfeng Tower.

27:48.020 --> 27:48.340
Understood.

27:53.740 --> 27:54.060
Your Highness, please.

27:54.260 --> 27:54.990
The carriage is too slow.

27:56.710 --> 27:57.100
Get down.

28:03.300 --> 28:04.630
Fang Tong, take the carriage.

28:04.870 --> 28:05.540
He can't ride.

28:28.990 --> 28:29.910
Third-Place Scholar,

28:33.020 --> 28:34.580
when you wake up,

28:35.630 --> 28:36.950
will you thank me

28:37.990 --> 28:39.340
or try to kill yourself?

28:40.540 --> 28:42.060
At least lying in my bed

28:42.990 --> 28:44.849
beats standing outside Wanyao's door

28:44.891 --> 28:46.171
in the cold rain.

28:46.950 --> 28:47.630
Besides,

28:49.060 --> 28:50.500
she can't even look after herself,

28:51.020 --> 28:53.430
yet she's playing at keeping pets.

28:53.740 --> 28:55.020
(Your Highness,
Princess Danyang is here.)

28:55.230 --> 28:56.230
(She says she's lost a cat.)

28:56.710 --> 28:58.020
(She saw it run in here.)

29:01.950 --> 29:03.710
Then show her to the flower hall.

29:03.990 --> 29:04.910
Make her comfortable.

29:05.190 --> 29:06.060
Let her wait!

29:07.020 --> 29:07.300
(Got it.)

29:11.630 --> 29:12.169
Meow, meow!

29:12.211 --> 29:12.809
(Your Highness, please return!)

29:12.851 --> 29:13.334
Come out, kitty!

29:13.376 --> 29:13.987
(Your Highness, please return!)

29:14.029 --> 29:14.669
- Meow, meow!
- (Your Highness, please return!)

29:15.020 --> 29:15.340
(Your Highness...)

29:15.870 --> 29:16.580
- Wanyao!
- (Your Highness, please return!)

29:17.020 --> 29:18.020
What's all this fuss?

29:22.230 --> 29:23.020
Forgive me, Aunt.

29:23.780 --> 29:25.300
I didn't mean to disturb your retreat.

29:25.740 --> 29:27.870
But that cat means the world to me.

29:28.780 --> 29:31.300
He's always by my side.

29:31.580 --> 29:32.670
I can't bear to be without him.

29:33.870 --> 29:35.820
He happened
to run into your residence today.

29:36.670 --> 29:37.500
So please,

29:37.870 --> 29:39.150
don't punish him.

29:39.540 --> 29:40.580
Why would I punish him?

29:41.990 --> 29:44.260
Would I really quarrel with an animal?

29:44.740 --> 29:47.020
And please, don't blame me either.

29:47.580 --> 29:49.580
I'll leave as soon as I find him.

29:50.710 --> 29:51.390
But

29:52.020 --> 29:52.740
I'll take back

29:53.820 --> 29:54.780
what's mine.

30:07.740 --> 30:08.430
Please, Aunt,

30:08.870 --> 30:09.780
let me search your residence.

31:38.740 --> 31:39.300
Your Highness...

31:57.340 --> 31:58.390
Take your time.

31:59.340 --> 32:00.580
I have no time for this.

32:04.780 --> 32:05.060
You...

32:10.100 --> 32:10.500
Yan Shang!

32:13.020 --> 32:13.470
Yan Shang!

32:18.100 --> 32:18.910
How strange.

32:19.390 --> 32:20.540
What is he doing here?

32:21.150 --> 32:22.910
Ask him yourself.

32:23.430 --> 32:23.870
Fine.

32:24.430 --> 32:25.150
I'll ask him

32:25.630 --> 32:26.470
when he wakes up.

32:27.670 --> 32:28.060
Let's go.

32:28.390 --> 32:28.870
Stop!

32:28.990 --> 32:29.740
Guards!

32:34.020 --> 32:34.950
Don't mind me.

32:35.150 --> 32:35.430
Shut up!

32:36.390 --> 32:36.990
Wanyao,

32:38.430 --> 32:39.910
stop playing dumb.

32:41.260 --> 32:42.780
Let's be frank.

32:43.260 --> 32:43.910
This man

32:44.300 --> 32:45.430
should count himself lucky

32:46.150 --> 32:47.500
that I'd even fancy him.

32:49.430 --> 32:51.540
You and I really do share

32:51.950 --> 32:52.710
the same taste.

32:53.470 --> 32:54.870
I happen to like him, too.

32:55.670 --> 32:56.910
To have us both fall for him,

32:57.300 --> 32:58.470
he's a lucky man indeed.

33:00.020 --> 33:00.820
So please, Aunt,

33:01.950 --> 33:02.780
let me take him away.

33:05.470 --> 33:06.190
Wanyao,

33:07.390 --> 33:09.390
you've spent too long in North Jing

33:09.780 --> 33:12.260
and forgotten your place here.

33:14.300 --> 33:15.740
You can remain in Sheng'an

33:16.300 --> 33:18.190
only at others' mercy!

33:20.190 --> 33:21.060
Thanks for the reminder.

33:22.670 --> 33:23.670
I know my place.

33:23.950 --> 33:25.150
Then leave him here

33:25.430 --> 33:27.300
and go home quietly.

33:27.670 --> 33:30.430
I'll forgive a young fool
who doesn't know any better.

33:31.340 --> 33:32.820
But mark my words.

33:33.390 --> 33:34.340
Even if

33:35.300 --> 33:36.390
you take him today,

33:37.150 --> 33:37.710
tomorrow,

33:38.470 --> 33:39.910
one word from me,

33:40.670 --> 33:42.020
and my agents

33:42.390 --> 33:43.540
will come to your door

33:44.020 --> 33:45.340
and bring him back to me.

33:45.740 --> 33:46.950
There's nothing you can do.

33:58.630 --> 33:59.260
What are you doing?

33:59.740 --> 34:00.870
This is my residence!

34:01.230 --> 34:02.060
Have you gone mad?

34:02.710 --> 34:03.500
You're right, Aunt.

34:04.540 --> 34:05.340
I have nothing.

34:05.990 --> 34:06.870
I am nothing.

34:07.430 --> 34:08.310
I can't ask for anything.

34:09.870 --> 34:10.830
And I can't take him away.

34:11.700 --> 34:12.180
So,

34:12.830 --> 34:13.470
I don't want him anymore.

34:14.540 --> 34:15.660
I might as well kill him.

34:17.140 --> 34:18.750
I'll kill him here today.

34:19.390 --> 34:19.910
Tomorrow,

34:20.500 --> 34:22.430
I'll go beg Father to forgive me.

34:23.390 --> 34:25.990
Blame the Third-Place Scholar's
bad luck.

34:27.270 --> 34:28.830
I'll borrow your fine residence

34:29.620 --> 34:31.830
to dispose of this pretty troublemaker.

34:33.540 --> 34:33.950
Stop!

34:42.580 --> 34:43.140
Out of the way!

34:43.790 --> 34:44.430
Let them go!

34:51.540 --> 34:51.910
You...

34:56.060 --> 34:57.750
You can't commit such a crime here.

34:58.700 --> 34:59.700
Take your thing

35:00.470 --> 35:01.060
and get out!

35:06.460 --> 35:09.900
(Grand Princess Luling's Residence)

35:27.060 --> 35:27.910
Your Highness...

35:29.020 --> 35:30.470
What on earth did she do to you?

35:30.910 --> 35:31.700
You're still out of your mind.

35:34.950 --> 35:35.830
Your Highness...

35:37.470 --> 35:38.390
Look at me carefully.

35:39.390 --> 35:40.540
Which princess am I?

35:46.620 --> 35:47.950
I know.

35:49.350 --> 35:50.060
You're...

35:51.830 --> 35:52.500
Mu...

35:53.430 --> 35:53.950
Wan...

35:55.100 --> 35:55.660
yao.

36:00.350 --> 36:01.700
You're only this bold

36:02.660 --> 36:03.830
when you're out of your mind.

36:05.060 --> 36:05.750
Once you come to,

36:06.910 --> 36:07.750
how much will you remember?

36:15.180 --> 36:15.990
Don't move.

36:19.700 --> 36:20.449
What are you doing?

36:20.491 --> 36:21.161
Wanyao...

36:26.140 --> 36:31.330
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

36:31.780 --> 36:37.810
♪- Through trails of mud and blood
- Let grief drown in your eyes♪

36:39.510 --> 36:43.000
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

36:43.050 --> 36:44.380
♪Burning bright as a song♪

36:44.580 --> 36:48.410
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

36:48.720 --> 36:53.090
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

36:54.140 --> 36:57.770
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

36:58.610 --> 37:00.800
♪Not a single hour less♪

37:00.850 --> 37:07.760
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

37:08.290 --> 37:11.730
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

37:11.930 --> 37:15.390
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

37:15.440 --> 37:22.440
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

37:22.660 --> 37:24.290
♪- May time be free of fear
- Boats rock♪

37:24.340 --> 37:25.189
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn
- May time be free of pain♪

37:25.231 --> 37:25.819
Your Highness, what's wrong?

37:27.500 --> 37:28.540
♪You're the only one I need♪

37:28.540 --> 37:29.060
Nothing.

37:29.870 --> 37:30.324
Keep driving.

37:30.366 --> 37:37.197
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

37:37.239 --> 37:40.345
♪Be my one and only in this world;
be my one and only in this life♪

37:40.800 --> 37:42.860
♪My last untouched innocence♪

37:47.660 --> 37:50.980
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

38:04.020 --> 38:04.990
Your Highness, we're here.

38:11.910 --> 38:12.270
Your Highness.

38:20.140 --> 38:21.159
Help me carry him down.

38:21.201 --> 38:21.851
I can't manage him alone.

38:22.990 --> 38:23.310
Got it.

38:25.080 --> 38:28.030
♪You're the only one I need♪

38:34.060 --> 38:35.270
Why is he lying on the ground?

38:35.870 --> 38:36.910
Her Highness could've warned me!

38:41.790 --> 38:43.470
Yan Shang, sit here for a moment.

38:44.870 --> 38:45.470
Thank you.

38:47.830 --> 38:48.790
So polite.

38:49.060 --> 38:49.950
You're barely conscious,

38:50.180 --> 38:51.220
yet you still remember your manners.

38:53.020 --> 38:53.870
A true scholar indeed.

39:22.660 --> 39:23.500
Don't push yourself.

39:23.950 --> 39:24.950
The physician will be here soon.

40:31.350 --> 40:33.140
Wh-what are you trying to do?

41:10.140 --> 41:10.580
Yan Shang!

41:37.430 --> 41:38.060
Your Highness.

41:39.500 --> 41:40.540
I'm sorry about earlier.

41:43.140 --> 41:43.500
You...

41:45.700 --> 41:46.580
You remember everything?

41:50.140 --> 41:50.700
I...

42:41.580 --> 42:42.500
When did you wake up?

42:43.620 --> 42:44.430
A little while ago.

42:46.540 --> 42:47.270
Why didn't you say anything?

42:48.830 --> 42:49.870
I was afraid you'd throw me out again

42:50.660 --> 42:51.950
if I spoke,

42:53.020 --> 42:53.990
just like last time.

42:57.580 --> 42:58.500
You were lucky this time.

43:00.100 --> 43:01.910
You're injured and caught a chill.

43:03.100 --> 43:04.430
Heartless as I am,

43:04.830 --> 43:06.220
I wouldn't throw you out tonight.

43:08.350 --> 43:09.100
Get some rest.

43:11.910 --> 43:12.470
Your Highness.

43:13.790 --> 43:14.470
Why?

43:15.350 --> 43:16.100
Why what?

43:16.910 --> 43:19.100
Why did you go alone
to the Grand Princess's

43:19.390 --> 43:20.220
and provoke her?

43:21.790 --> 43:23.310
She's the last person in Sheng'an

43:23.830 --> 43:25.270
you should offend.

43:25.470 --> 43:26.310
You have the nerve to say that?

43:27.430 --> 43:28.060
If I hadn't come,

43:28.790 --> 43:30.540
she would've devoured you alive.

43:30.750 --> 43:31.470
So what?

43:31.990 --> 43:32.830
What do you mean?

43:37.500 --> 43:38.830
Are you in your right mind?

43:41.750 --> 43:43.310
So what if I couldn't escape

43:44.350 --> 43:45.100
the Grand Princess?

43:46.580 --> 43:48.750
Why risk your life to save me?

43:50.620 --> 43:51.060
Yan Shang,

43:52.180 --> 43:53.430
don't think that being injured

43:54.350 --> 43:55.500
will stop me from throwing you out.

43:56.750 --> 43:58.430
Because Your Highness feels about me

43:59.620 --> 44:01.220
exactly as I feel

44:03.620 --> 44:04.470
about Your Highness.

44:18.910 --> 44:19.430
Your Highness,

44:21.430 --> 44:22.500
at the banquet that day,

44:24.140 --> 44:25.180
I wanted to tell you...

44:25.580 --> 44:25.990
Yan Shang.

44:28.140 --> 44:28.750
Don't say it.

44:37.910 --> 44:38.830
What happened tonight,

44:40.620 --> 44:41.350
and whatever lies between us,

44:43.910 --> 44:44.620
ends here.

44:47.620 --> 44:48.500
There are too many things

44:50.100 --> 44:51.470
left unfinished in Sheng'an.

44:53.950 --> 44:54.790
Even if I achieve everything

44:56.060 --> 44:56.830
I've set out to do one day,

44:58.830 --> 44:59.470
I'll never

45:01.310 --> 45:02.910
form a bond with anyone

45:03.910 --> 45:04.390
or marry.

45:11.870 --> 45:12.540
I'll say this

45:13.950 --> 45:14.830
only once.

45:18.020 --> 45:18.950
Don't bring it up again.

45:21.700 --> 45:22.310
Why?

45:37.260 --> 45:41.860
(Next Episode Preview)

45:42.540 --> 45:43.870
Everyone in Sheng'an knows

45:43.950 --> 45:45.790
how talented you are, Mr. Wei.

45:46.220 --> 45:46.910
You...

45:47.180 --> 45:48.310
you're not wed yet, are you?

45:48.830 --> 45:49.500
Your Highness,

45:49.950 --> 45:50.540
what is it?

45:50.700 --> 45:52.310
The most sought-after
young man of the Wei family

45:53.060 --> 45:53.990
is none other than you.

45:54.700 --> 45:56.700
And you're much more to my taste.

45:58.840 --> 46:02.133
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

46:04.818 --> 46:09.734
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

46:11.928 --> 46:17.773
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

46:18.273 --> 46:23.499
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

46:26.268 --> 46:31.059
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

46:31.895 --> 46:37.974
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

46:39.775 --> 46:42.925
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

46:42.925 --> 46:44.573
♪Burning bright as a song♪

46:44.625 --> 46:48.349
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

46:48.727 --> 46:53.393
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

46:54.012 --> 46:58.053
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

46:58.544 --> 47:00.659
♪Not a single hour less♪

47:00.699 --> 47:07.645
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

47:08.408 --> 47:11.861
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

47:12.041 --> 47:15.186
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

47:15.625 --> 47:22.262
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

47:22.659 --> 47:24.697
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

47:24.697 --> 47:27.173
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

47:27.211 --> 47:29.680
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:29.884 --> 47:36.771
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

47:37.083 --> 47:40.354
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

47:40.659 --> 47:43.832
♪My last untouched innocence♪

47:44.156 --> 47:47.582
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

47:47.815 --> 47:51.040
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

47:51.371 --> 47:58.167
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

47:58.536 --> 48:00.598
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

48:00.599 --> 48:03.102
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

48:03.149 --> 48:05.487
♪You're the only one I need♪

48:05.718 --> 48:12.553
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

48:12.902 --> 48:14.520
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

48:14.650 --> 48:16.446
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

48:16.803 --> 48:19.820
♪You're the only one I need♪

48:19.860 --> 48:21.187
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
